      "content": "Textual Rig Console — Slice 2: EvidenceRailWidget",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Draft.** Completed alongside Slice 1.1 (structured blocker_summary). Provides a content-light receipt timeline widget that renders metadata-only receipt summaries from `EvidenceRailProjection`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Why EvidenceRailWidget Exists",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The `SessionPaneWidget` only shows aggregate receipt counts and latest kind. The `EvidenceRailWidget` provides a scrollable list of individual receipt items — but only metadata (tool name, status, error kind, path, duration). No raw logs, file contents, diffs, or command transcripts.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This is the second projection type in the Rig Console. Both widgets consume projections, never raw data.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "EvidenceRailProjection Fields",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`session_id`",
          "str",
          "Session identifier"
        ],
        [
          "`receipt_count`",
          "int",
          "Total receipts (capped)"
        ],
        [
          "`mutation_count`",
          "int",
          "Receipts with `changed=True`"
        ],
        [
          "`refusal_count`",
          "int",
          "Receipts with `status=\"refused\"`"
        ],
        [
          "`timeout_count`",
          "int",
          "Receipts with timeout status/error_kind"
        ],
        [
          "`items`",
          "list[EvidenceRailItemProjection]",
          "Content-light receipt items (capped at 20)"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "EvidenceRailItemProjection Fields",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-10",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Field",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`event_id`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "Source event identifier"
        ],
        [
          "`captured_at`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "ISO 8601 timestamp"
        ],
        [
          "`tool_name`",
          "str",
          "Tool that produced the receipt"
        ],
        [
          "`status`",
          "str",
          "Receipt status (success, refused, error, etc.)"
        ],
        [
          "`error_kind`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "Structured error classification"
        ],
        [
          "`path`",
          "str \\",
          "None",
          "File path (display-only)"
        ],
        [
          "`changed`",
          "bool \\",
          "None",
          "Whether a mutation occurred"
        ],
        [
          "`duration_ms`",
          "float \\",
          "None",
          "Execution duration in ms"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What the Widget Shows",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Header** — \"Evidence [session_id]\" 2. **Counts row** — receipts, mutations, refusals, timeouts (positive only) 3. **Item list** — one line per receipt: - Right-aligned tool name (capped at 16 chars) - Status text - Error kind in brackets (if present) - Shortened file path (if present) - Duration in ms (if present) 4. **Empty state** — \"No receipts yet.\"",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Adapter: evidence_rail_from_receipt_index()",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A pure function that converts `list[ToolReceiptIndexRecord]` (from `rig_relay/evidence/receipt_index.py`) into an `EvidenceRailProjection`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Extracts only metadata fields — no raw output - Counts mutations (search_replace with changed=True) - Counts refusals (status=refused) - Counts timeouts (status=timed_out or bash error_kind=timeout) - Orders by `captured_at` descending - Caps items (default 20) - Does not read files, parse JSONL, or touch disk",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What It Intentionally Does Not Do",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- No raw stdout/stderr rendering - No file contents or diffs - No direct JSONL parsing inside the widget - No mutation actions - No session lifecycle controls",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Cross-References",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
